    "en": {
      "trackName": "Air Force: Watch Games",
      "description": "Experience the thrill of classic arcade shooting directly on your wrist. This is a retro air combat game designed specifically for your watch, bringing the golden age of arcade gaming to a wearable device.\nKey Features:\nPrecise Control with Watch Crown\nForget about blocking the screen with your fingers. Simply rotate the watch crown to steer your fighter jet with high precision. The smooth control mechanism allows you to dodge complex bullet patterns effortlessly.\nClassic Arcade Experience\nRelive the nostalgia of 1945 style shooters. Fight against waves of enemies and giant bosses anywhere, anytime. Perfect for quick sessions when you do not want to use your phone.\nPowerful Arsenal\nUpgrade your fighter with a variety of powerful items.\nLaser: Cut through enemy lines instantly.\nMissile: Track and destroy targets automatically.\nShield: Protect your ship from deadly collisions.\nFlame: Burn everything in your path.\nDownload now and start your aerial battle on your wrist.",
      "releaseNotes": "",
